The Mediator Assistant Agent supports mediators and insolvency professionals in managing the flow of negotiation sessions. It acts as a real-time digital co-pilot—summarizing discussions, tracking commitments, and identifying common ground among parties. By monitoring dialogue content, it highlights areas of convergence and unresolved issues for structured follow-up.";}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1761648557;}s:7:"creator";s:11:"Atul Grover";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:11:"last_change";a:9:{s:4:"date";i:1761648557;s:2:"ip";s:13:"49.43.109.130";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:78:"digital_agents:mediation_agents:hearing_facilitations:mediator_assistant_agent";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:3:"sum";s:7:"created";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:930;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}}